1	[![smithery badge](https://smithery.ai/badge/@staruml/staruml-mcp-server)](https://smithery.ai/server/@staruml/staruml-mcp-server)
2	
3	# StarUML MCP Server
4	
5	[StarUML](https://staruml.io) is a sophisticated modeler for agile and concise modeling. **StarUML MCP Server** enables you to create diagrams or generate codes from diagrams in StarUML via prompts.
6	
7	## Setup
8	
9	Prerequisite:
10	
11	- [StarUML](https://staruml.io/) `v7.0.0` or higher
12	- [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) `v22` or higher
13	
14	Set up `claude_desktop_config.json` in Claude Desktop as follows:
15	
16	```json
17	{
18	  "mcpServers": {
19	    "staruml-mcp-server": {
20	      "command": "npx",
21	      "args": ["-y", "staruml-mcp-server"]
22	    }
23	  }
24	}
25	```
26	
27	You can use the `--api-port=<port>` option to change the API server port for StarUML.
28	
29	## Example Prompts
30	
31	- _"Create a class diagram for book store in StarUML"_
32	- _"Create a sequence diagram for OAuth authentication in StarUML"_
33	- _"Generate SQL DDL from the current ERD diagram in StarUML"_
34	
35	## Tools
36	
37	- `generate_diagram`
38	- `get_current_diagram_info`
39	- `get_all_diagrams_info`
40	- `get_diagram_image_by_id`
41	
42	## Dev
43	
44	1. Clone this repository.
45	2. Build with `npm run build`.
46	3. Update `claude_desktop_config.json` in Claude Desktop as below.
47	4. Restart Claude Desktop.
48	
49	```json
50	{
51	  "mcpServers": {
52	    "staruml-mcp-server": {
53	      "command": "node",
54	      "args": ["<full-path-to>/staruml-mcp-server/build/index.js"]
55	    }
56	  }
57	}
58	```
59	

